### List all
GET http://localhost:3000/api/menu

### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Soup","price":20}

### Find by name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/menu/Soup

### Update (replace 1 with the created item_id)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/menu/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Veggie Burger","price":37}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/menu/1
